kable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][1440,3120]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.ScrollView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="true" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,129][1440,2640]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,129][1380,1945]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="A: 屏幕刷新会产生显示驱动 work，可能与 exploit 注入的内核 work 竞争，是概率性崩溃的最大来源。熄屏后显示驱动停止，成功率显著提高。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,129][1320,215]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="Q: KernelSU Manager 显示“未安装”怎么办？" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,253][1032,319]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /><node index="2" text="A: 驱动已加载但 Manager 首次检测可能失败。强制停止 Manager 后重新打开，应显示“工作中 &lt;LKM&gt; [越狱模式]”。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,327][1320,453]" drawing-order="2" hint="" /><node index="3" text="Q: 这个方案会熔断 KNOX 吗？" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,491][732,557]" drawing-order="3" hint="" /><node index="4" text="A: 不会。本方案通过内核漏洞（CVE-2026-43499）免解锁提权，不刷 bootloader，KNOX e-fuse 状态保持原样（设置页可查看本机状态）。仅当设备之前已经解锁熔断（0x1）时无法恢复；Secure Folder 等 KNOX 功能在 root 后需用 KnoxPatch 恢复，与本方案是否熔断无关。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,565][1320,871]" drawing-order="4" hint="" /><node index="5" text="Q: KNOX 状态检测准吗？重启后会变吗？" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,909][942,975]" drawing-order="5" hint="" /><node index="6" text="A: 本 App 读取的是开机时 bootloader 写入的 ro.boot.warranty_bit（实时读取）。KNOX e-fuse 是硬件一次性状态：熔断不可逆，重启/刷机都不会改变。KnoxPatch 之类的模块只 hook 应用层检测 API，不修改该属性，所以显示的是真实值；若安装过 resetprop 类覆盖属性的模块，显示值可能被改，但硬件真实状态不变。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,983][1320,1349]" drawing-order="6" hint="" /><node index="7" text="Q: KnoxPatch / Secure Folder 怎么用？" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,1387][941,1453]" drawing-order="7" hint="" /><node index="8" text="A: 在 KernelSU Manager 安装 Zygisk-Next 和 LSPosed 模块，安装 KnoxPatch APK，在 LSPosed 里启用后重启 Zygote，打开 KnoxPatch 勾选 Secure Folder 即可。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,1461][1320,1647]" drawing-order="8" hint="" /><node index="9" text="Q: 卸载/恢复原样？" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,1685][509,1751]" drawing-order="9" hint="" /><node index="10" text="A: 无需卸载——重启手机即恢复原状（模块文件保留在 /data/adb，不影响正常使用）。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,1759][1320,1885]" drawing-order="10" hint="" /></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,2005][1380,2409]" drawing-order="1" hint=""><node index="0" text="免责声明" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[211,2065][410,2140]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="本工具仅用于安全研究与自有设备维护。使用内核漏洞存在导致系统崩溃/数据丢失的风险，使用者需自行承担一切后果。请勿用于非法用途。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,2163][1320,2349]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /></node><node index="2" text="RootMyS9280 · 基于 CVE-2026-43499 安全研究适配 S9280 DZF2 · GPL-3.0" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,2454][1380,2580]" drawing-order="2" hint="" /></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,2640][1440,3120]" drawing-order="1" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,2640][1440,2940]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="cn.nano